<title>LITHUANIA: PLUOSHTAS 7-MO SALES 154 MLN LITAS.</title>
<headline>PLUOSHTAS 7-MO SALES 154 MLN LITAS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven months 1997</p>
<p>					(million litas unless stated)</p>
<p> Sales				 154	vs   116.1</p>
<p> Sales in July			18.6     vs   12.5</p>
<p>Dirbtinis Pluoshtas, a producer of acetate yarn, reported a</p>
<p>six-month profit of 6.7 million litas versus 2.6 million litas</p>
<p>in the same period last year.</p>
<p>4.09 million litas in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
</text>
